test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4815684Z     design              Choose and build a device from a typed electrical
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4816100Z                         goal.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4816425Z     prompt              Natural-language request -> intent, layout,
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4816798Z                         verification, simulation, report.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4817166Z     generate            Generate verified artifacts from a DSL file.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4817530Z     verify              Verify a DSL file (no export).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4817915Z     epr                 Loss-participation (EPR) and coherence estimate for a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4818325Z                         DSL file. EPR_ANALYTICAL_ONLY by default; never a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4818649Z                         field solution.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4818988Z     evidence            Inspect and validate evidence ledgers (the source of
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4819367Z                         truth for every physics claim).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4819741Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4820172Z     jobs                Start, inspect, collect, cancel, and resume persistent
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4820509Z                         local solver jobs.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4820809Z     serve               Run the FastAPI plugin server.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4821159Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4821564Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4821976Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4822326Z                         not manufacturability.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4822671Z     chip                Multi-qubit chip-level frequency-collision analysis. A
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4823074Z                         single-device closed loop cannot answer whether a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4823409Z                         processor works.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4824072Z     pdk                 Foundry PDK abstraction: list registered technologies
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4824472Z                         or inspect a PDK's full provenance and process
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4824788Z                         parameters.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4825148Z     measurement         Simulation-vs-measurement correlation: the path from
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4825576Z                         illustrative to fab-calibrated numbers.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4825970Z     kqcircuits-cpw      Generate verified straight CPW gap masks via an
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4826368Z                         isolated KQCircuits runtime; no EM simulation.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4829138Z     quantum-metal-mask  Generate independently checked charge-pad/ground
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4829649Z                         masks; no junction or EM simulation.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4830011Z     pyepr-circuit       Run an ideal one-mode circuit with
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4830384Z                         convergence/reference checks; no EM extraction.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4830814Z     circuitq-lc         Run ideal LC with fixed grid/domain/reference checks;
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4831173Z                         no EM extraction.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4831528Z     sqcircuit-lc        Run specified ideal LC with fixed eigenpair/reference
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-13T16:00:29.4831911Z                         checks; no EM extraction.
